        },
        {
          "text": " Diri guddaani fulla saditi gargari dayae, dira lafa ch'ufa keesa jiru balleesani. Waaqi dira Babiloni gudda qaabate, daad'i mudunu ufi obaase, daad'i dalansu isaa. ",
